      "id": 26,
      "title": "Inspect traces without replay",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 86,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Open **Explore → Tempo** and search the exact trace ID from `jevable runs traces <run-id>`, or follow a trace link in a structured log. Missing/expired/unsampled traces do not authorize retry. Dashboard data is diagnostic and can lag, be sampled or be dropped. Review alert state in Prometheus through the Grafana data source; no notification destination is configured."
      }
